%% SCRUM-57 / A07 analysis interaction, participants are conceptual responsibilities.
%% Source baseline: 20a41e48c71e0851bf9c71de9ba580cf1623323a.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Authorized maintainer
    participant B as Adoption boundary
    participant C as Adoption control
    participant I as Identity boundary
    participant R as Catalog records
    participant E as Audit evidence

    M->>B: Submit product + exact source formula + target specification IDs
    B->>C: Adopt newer specification explicitly
    C->>I: Authenticate and require DATA.MAINTAIN + FORMULA.RELEASE
    alt Identity missing or permission denied
        I-->>C: Reject identity or authorization
        C-->>B: 401 AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED or 403 AUTHORIZATION_DENIED
        B-->>M: Error, no catalog or adoption audit writes
    else Authorized actor
        Note over C,E: One transaction governs validation, snapshot, selection and all audit writes
        C->>R: Serialize product, then exact source version
        R-->>C: Current pointer, source release state and source items
        C->>C: Check source ownership, RELEASED state, current pointer and Y flag
        Note over C,R: Any failed guard exits at its step, without executing later calls
        C->>R: Serialize distinct material IDs in sorted order
        C->>R: Serialize target + source specification IDs in sorted order
        R-->>C: Exact specification versions and evidence
        C->>C: Validate specification/material bindings, target eligibility and newness
        alt Source stale or a precondition fails
            C-->>B: 400 / 404 / 409 / 422 business rejection
            B-->>M: Stable error, no new snapshot or audit residue
        else Eligible explicit adoption
            C->>R: Create fresh draft at highest allocated version + 1
            C->>R: Copy all items, replace target-material specification references
            Note over C,R: Preserve material, sequence, quantity and unit, allocate fresh item IDs
            C->>E: FORMULA_CREATED
            C->>R: Release new formula and select it as current
            Note over C,R: Old selection Y to N, old content and release facts stay unchanged
            C->>E: FORMULA_RELEASED
            C->>E: FORMULA_SPECIFICATION_ADOPTED with source, target and new IDs
            alt Every persistence and audit step succeeds
                C->>R: Commit transaction
                C-->>B: Released new formula snapshot with items
                B-->>M: 201 Created
            else Any persistence or audit step fails before commit
                Note over C,E: Failure can occur at any write above, all changes share this transaction
                C->>R: Roll back snapshot, items, selection and all audit events
                C-->>B: Conflict or generic internal error
                B-->>M: 409 DATA_CONFLICT or 500 INTERNAL_ERROR
            end
        end
        Note over C,R: Published label, declarations and label pointer remain unchanged
    end
